{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_E1346224","title":"A Residential Reload","entry":"Dlg_E1346224::entry","exit":"Dlg_E1346224::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_14E96A03","articyId":"72057628397670649","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Well if it isn't the noodle crew back with the mid-day hues. Is it mid-day? Who in Luna's oddly bright reflection knows?","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well if it isn't the noodle crew back with the mid-day hues. Is it mid-day? Who in Luna's oddly bright reflection knows?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-1186.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16859","byteOffset":14269704,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_552CF633","articyId":"72057628397670663","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Hang the mic up? Hang. The. MIC UP?! What would I do? Where would they get the news? The announcements? Theeeeeee announcements. Think of them! Who will tell you whennnnn-- NOW we break to a developing story coming live out of Metrohub.","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hang the mic up? Hang. The. MIC UP?! What would I do? Where would they get the news? The announcements? Theeeeeee announcements. Think of them! Who will tell you whennnnn-- NOW we break to a developing story coming live out of Metrohub.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20447","byteOffset":15618224,"byteLength":580}},{"id":"DFr_F1FF117E","articyId":"72057628397670684","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"I know this. We're no where near Metrohub... right. Of course. But what we are near issss.... Hayden hail-to-the-queen Weather Woman! What do you have for us Hay?","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I know this. We're no where near Metrohub... right. Of course. But what we are near issss.... Hayden hail-to-the-queen Weather Woman! What do you have for us Hay?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1187.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31841","byteOffset":19926920,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_648CC928","articyId":"72057628397670717","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Huh. How 'bout that. Well, you know what they say: things don't actually happen unless there's someone telling you about it! And with that that I'm off! This has been Kai Reston coming live to you from Nivalis.","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Huh. How 'bout that. Well, you know what they say: things don't actually happen unless there's someone telling you about it! And with that that I'm off! This has been Kai Reston coming live to you from Nivalis.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41040","byteOffset":29854656,"byteLength":520}},{"id":"DFr_4AE225B2","articyId":"72057628397670726","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"What's happening in Metrohub? What's happening in Metrohub?! I'll tell you what's happening in Metrohub.... metro-ey things. And crime. There's definitely crime. We're reporting thefts, data jacking, punks commandeering corporate real estate! It's madness.","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What's happening in Metrohub? What's happening in Metrohub?! I'll tell you what's happening in Metrohub.... metro-ey things. And crime. There's definitely crime. We're reporting thefts, data jacking, punks commandeering corporate real estate! It's madness.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1175.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41317","byteOffset":29957976,"byteLength":564}},{"id":"DFr_5C7D4CC3","articyId":"72057628397670746","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Seen no, reporting yes. That's the way the news works! Time to run, gotta get ready for my evening broadcast. Tune in next time and we'll make you guess what's actually happening in this city. Till then, this is Kai Reston signing off.","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Seen no, reporting yes. That's the way the news works! Time to run, gotta get ready for my evening broadcast. Tune in next time and we'll make you guess what's actually happening in this city. Till then, this is Kai Reston signing off.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22049","byteOffset":16228128,"byteLength":544}},{"id":"DFr_F13CE0AF","articyId":"72057697117150156","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Now that's an intriguing question. Could add it to the bank of interview q's I have stashed away somewhere. Now if I could only remember where that was...","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Now that's an intriguing question. Could add it to the bank of interview q's I have stashed away somewhere. Now if I could only remember where that was...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":-587.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20107","byteOffset":15492416,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_B04CA685","articyId":"72057697117150177","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Questions, questions, questions! Fine! I'll tell you what I know... There's a data theft downtown and we have a crew on the way. Any thoughts from locals in the area? Huh? Anything at all?","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Questions, questions, questions! Fine! I'll tell you what I know... There's a data theft downtown and we have a crew on the way. Any thoughts from locals in the area? Huh? Anything at all?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20500","byteOffset":15638112,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_E4D763AC","articyId":"72057697117150195","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Sponsors? We have tons! But of course the one we love is.... CameoPOV media! That's right, run right out our very own Helix Monumental, Cameo is the company putting YOU into the life of your dreams.","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sponsors? We have tons! But of course the one we love is.... CameoPOV media! That's right, run right out our very own Helix Monumental, Cameo is the company putting YOU into the life of your dreams.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48273","byteOffset":32598904,"byteLength":544}},{"id":"DFr_65805889","articyId":"72057697117150231","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Oh I don't keep track of the sponsors! I have enough to cover with the news coming outta Nivalis. Speaking of!","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh I don't keep track of the sponsors! I have enough to cover with the news coming outta Nivalis. Speaking of!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":3250.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37386","byteOffset":28481904,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_747129D1","articyId":"72057697117150238","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Could be! I don't keep track of the sponsors! I have enough to cover with the news coming outta Nivalis. Speaking of!","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Could be! I don't keep track of the sponsors! I have enough to cover with the news coming outta Nivalis. Speaking of!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":3250.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51003","byteOffset":33635248,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_F0514859","articyId":"72057628397670655","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Kai, might be time for you to hang the mic up.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Kai, might be time for you to hang the mic up.","TextSheVersion":"Kai, might be time for you to hang the mic up.","TextTheyVersion":"Kai, might be time for you to hang the mic up."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":300.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21629","byteOffset":16072912,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_69881FF9","articyId":"72057628397670670","type":"choice","className"